# Rule 10(b)(i): proceed in Oslo.TSS.NortheastBound.1 in its general direction of traffic flow (NortheastBound; simulator heading 315, 0 = east, y south) within 45 degrees; Rule 10(c): or cross it at right angles (within 15 degrees)
